  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Nordkamp",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Nordkamp.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Marloes Nordkamp is an independent Consultant Specialist GP (ABN: 70 688 660 649) (MED0001198788) consulting at the Earlwood / Sans Souci centres.",
      "Dr Marloes Nordkamp completed her medical studies in the Netherlands and worked in emergency medicine in a small rural hospital.",
      "She moved to Australia in 2006 and has worked at Westmead Hospital until the end of 2013. She gained experience in many different specialities and completed her Diploma in Obstetrics and Gynaecology, Diploma in Child Health and the Family Planning Certificate in Reproductive and Sexual Health.",
      "She gained fellowship as a Specialist GP in January 2017 and has enjoyed working as a GP on the South Coast NSW in a rural general practice as well as in an Aboriginal organisation for women and children. Her main interests are Paediatrics, Women's Health, Menopause treatment, and Chronic Disease Management.",
      "Dr Marloes provides antenatal shared care and all facets of women's health including implanon insertion."
    ]
  },
  "fellowships": [
    "Specialist in General Practice, Medical Board of Australia",
